{"id":"luego","lemma":"luego","pos":"adv","rank":151,"glosses":["then (afterward)","later, later on (at some point in the future)","soon (within a short time)"],"ipa":"/ˈlweɡo/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-luego.wav","examples":[{"text":"Te lo digo luego.","en":"I'll tell you later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221746"},{"text":"Te lo cuento luego.","en":"I'll tell you later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/221747"},{"text":"¿Quién quiere ir luego?","en":"Who wants to go next?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454121"},{"text":"Desde luego, te recuerdo.","en":"Of course, I remember you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803757"},{"text":"Vuelve a recogerme luego.","en":"Come back and pick me up later.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645666"}]}